+   <li>We reuse tracked hand crops. We rejected a more aggressive scan-skipping experiment because it missed additional hands.</li>
+   <li>We replaced gesture rules with a 21 KB network trained on hand landmarks. We kept the image models and their input resolution unchanged.</li>
+  </ul>
